umb ph-a\"><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering Staffing</a> / Plumbing BIM Engineers</p><h1 class=\"h1 ph-a long\">Plumbing BIM engineers <em>for drainage, water and fire.</em></h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Specialists in gravity drainage, water supply and fire-fighting systems, modelled with the falls and clearances they need.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">MEP</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Plumbing BIM Engineers placed onsite, remotely or as part of a dedicated team, <em>each one assessed before you meet them.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Plumbing%20BIM%20Engineers\">Request Plumbing BIM Engineers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Plumbing BIM Engineer</li><li>Public Health BIM Modeler</li><li>Fire Fighting BIM Modeler</li><li>Plumbing BIM Coordinator</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Model drainage with correct falls, and water supply networks</li><li>Model sprinkler and fire-fighting systems from design drawings</li><li>Coordinate gravity lines first, before pressurised services take the space</li><li>Produce plumbing and fire-fighting shop drawings and riser diagrams</li><li>Check access to valves, cleanouts and equipment</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Revit MEP</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>AutoCAD</span><span>ACC</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\